  "result": {
    "engine": "knitr",
    "markdown": "# Praktikum Analisis Rasio {#sec-p-rasio}\n\nPraktikum ini menyertai @sec-rasio. Kita menerapkan model Pabon-Lasso,\nmenghitung biaya satuan, lalu menganalisis variabel kontekstual.\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nhospital <- load_hospital()\n```\n:::\n\n\n## Analisis Pabon-Lasso\n\n### Membuat grafik Pabon-Lasso\n\nModel Pabon-Lasso memetakan setiap rumah sakit berdasarkan tingkat hunian\ntempat tidur (*bed occupancy rate*, BOR) dan perputaran tempat tidur (*bed\nturnover*, BTO). Garis rerata kedua indikator membagi grafik menjadi empat\nsektor.\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Rerata bed turnover dan bed occupancy\nmean_btr <- mean(hospital$throughput)\nmean_bor <- mean(hospital$bed_occ)\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nhospital |>\n  ggplot() +\n  geom_point(aes(x = bed_occ, y = throughput)) +\n  geom_hline(yintercept = mean_btr) +\n  geom_vline(xintercept = mean_bor)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![Grafik Pabon-Lasso sederhana](p2-analisis-rasio_files/figure-html/fig-p-pl-sederhana-1.png){#fig-p-pl-sederhana fig-align='center' width=85%}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nhospital |>\n  ggplot() +\n  geom_point(\n    aes(x = bed_occ, y = throughput, colour = publichospital, size = beds),\n    alpha = 0.5\n  ) +\n  geom_hline(yintercept = mean_btr, linetype = \"dashed\") +\n  geom_vline(xintercept = mean_bor, linetype = \"dashed\") +\n  annotate(\"text\", x = c(-Inf, -Inf, Inf, Inf), y = c(-Inf, Inf, Inf, -Inf),\n           hjust = c(-0.1, -0.1, 1.1, 1.1), vjust = c(-0.6, 1.6, 1.6, -0.6),\n           label = paste(\"Sektor\", 1:4), colour = \"grey40\") +\n  labs(\n    x = \"Bed Occupancy Rate\", y = \"Bed Turnover\",\n    colour = \"Kepemilikan\", size = \"Jumlah Tempat Tidur\"\n  )\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![Model Pabon-Lasso menurut kepemilikan dan ukuran rumah sakit](p2-analisis-rasio_files/figure-html/fig-p-pl-1.png){#fig-p-pl fig-align='center' width=85%}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Membuat variabel sektor\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Membuat variabel sektor berdasarkan hasil Analisis Pabon-Lasso\nhospital <- hospital |>\n  mutate(sector = case_when(\n    throughput <= mean_btr & bed_occ <= mean_bor ~ 1,\n    throughput >  mean_btr & bed_occ <= mean_bor ~ 2,\n    throughput >  mean_btr & bed_occ >  mean_bor ~ 3,\n    throughput <= mean_btr & bed_occ >  mean_bor ~ 4\n  ))\n\n# Label sektor, lalu ubah menjadi variabel kategorik (factor)\nvar_label(hospital$sector) <- \"Sektor\"\nval_labels(hospital$sector) <- c(\"Sektor 1\" = 1, \"Sektor 2\" = 2,\n                                 \"Sektor 3\" = 3, \"Sektor 4\" = 4)\nhospital$sector <- to_factor(hospital$sector)\n\n# Membuat variabel biner efisiensi: rumah sakit di Sektor 3 dianggap efisien\nhospital <- hospital |>\n  mutate(efisien_pl = factor(if_else(sector == \"Sektor 3\", \"Efisien\", \"Tidak\"),\n                             levels = c(\"Efisien\", \"Tidak\")))\nvar_label(hospital$efisien_pl) <- \"Efisiensi (Pabon-Lasso)\"\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {#tbl-p-sektor .cell layout-align=\"center\" tbl-cap='Sebaran rumah sakit menurut sektor Pabon-Lasso'}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nhospital |>\n  select(sector, efisien_pl) |>\n  tbl_summary() |>\n  as_flex_table()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"tabwid\"><style>.cl-0e141030{}.cl-0e057e12{font-family:'Arial';font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);background-color:transparent;}.cl-0e057e3a{font-family:'Arial';font-size:6.6pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:super;}.cl-0e057e3b{font-family:'Arial';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);background-color:transparent;}.cl-0e057e3c{font-f