cl-0e057e3b\">77 (39%)</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-0e0c20dc\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf8b\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\">Sektor 2</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-0e0c20dd\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf8a\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\">18 (9.1%)</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-0e0c20dc\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf8b\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\">Sektor 3</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-0e0c20dd\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf8a\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\">75 (38%)</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-0e0c20dc\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf8b\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\">Sektor 4</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-0e0c20dd\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf8a\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\">28 (14%)</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-0e0c20dc\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf81\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\">Efisiensi (Pabon-Lasso)</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-0e0c20dd\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf8a\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\"></span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-0e0c20dc\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf8b\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\">Efisien</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-0e0c20dd\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf8a\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\">75 (38%)</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-0e0c20e6\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf8b\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\">Tidak</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-0e0c20e7\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf8a\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\">123 (62%)</span></p></td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td  colspan=\"2\"class=\"cl-0e0c20f0\"><p class=\"cl-0e0baf94\"><span class=\"cl-0e057e3c\">1</span><span class=\"cl-0e057e3b\">n (%)</span></p></td></tr></tfoot></table></div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Analisis perhitungan biaya\n\n### Menghitung biaya satuan per jenis layanan\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nhospital <- hospital |>\n  mutate(\n    unitcost_op = totalcost_op / outpatients,\n    unitcost_ip = totalcost_ip / admissions1,\n    unitcost_bd = total_cost_bd / bed_days\n  ) |>\n  set_variable_labels(\n    unitcost_op = \"Biaya satuan rawat jalan\",\n    unitcost_ip = \"Biaya satuan rawat inap\",\n    unitcost_bd = \"Biaya satuan per hari rawat\"\n  )\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {#tbl-p-unitcost .cell layout-align=\"center\" tbl-cap='Rerata (simpangan baku) biaya satuan'}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nhospital |>\n  select(unitcost_op, unitcost_ip, unitcost_bd) |>\n  tbl_summary(\n    digits = all_continuous() ~ 2,\n    statistic = all_continuous() ~ \"{mean} ({sd})\"\n  ) |>\n  as_flex_table()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"tabwid\"><style>.cl-0eb23cec{}.cl-0ea502ca{font-family:'Arial';font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);background-color:transparent;}.cl-0ea502d4{font-family:'Arial';font-size:6.6pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:super;}.cl-0ea502de{font-family:'Arial';font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);background-color:transparent;}.cl-0ea502e8{font-family:'Arial';font-size:6pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:super;}.cl-0eaa6efe{margin:0;text-align:left;border-bottom: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-top: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-left: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-right: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);padding-bottom:2pt;padding-top:2pt;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;line-height: 1;background-color:transparent;}.cl-0eaa6f08{margin:0;text-align:center;border-bottom: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-top: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-left: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-right: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);padding-bottom:2pt;padding-top:2pt;padding-left: