-0ea502de\">Biaya satuan rawat jalan</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-0eaac25a\"><p class=\"cl-0eaa6f13\"><span class=\"cl-0ea502de\">29.93 (38.04)</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-0eaac250\"><p class=\"cl-0eaa6f12\"><span class=\"cl-0ea502de\">Biaya satuan rawat inap</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-0eaac25a\"><p class=\"cl-0eaa6f13\"><span class=\"cl-0ea502de\">297.58 (194.62)</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-0eaac264\"><p class=\"cl-0eaa6f12\"><span class=\"cl-0ea502de\">Biaya satuan per hari rawat</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-0eaac26e\"><p class=\"cl-0eaa6f13\"><span class=\"cl-0ea502de\">82.35 (54.61)</span></p></td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td  colspan=\"2\"class=\"cl-0eaac278\"><p class=\"cl-0eaa6f1c\"><span class=\"cl-0ea502e8\">1</span><span class=\"cl-0ea502de\">Mean (SD)</span></p></td></tr></tfoot></table></div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Kombinasi model Pabon-Lasso dan analisis biaya\n\nRumah sakit dianggap efisien pada suatu layanan bila berada di Sektor 3\n**dan** biaya satuannya di bawah rerata.\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nhospital <- hospital |>\n  mutate(\n    efisien_ar_op = sector == \"Sektor 3\" & unitcost_op < mean(unitcost_op),\n    efisien_ar_ip = sector == \"Sektor 3\" & unitcost_ip < mean(unitcost_ip),\n    efisien_ar_bd = sector == \"Sektor 3\" & unitcost_bd < mean(unitcost_bd)\n  ) |>\n  set_variable_labels(\n    efisien_ar_op = \"Efisiensi Rawat Jalan\",\n    efisien_ar_ip = \"Efisiensi Rawat Inap\",\n    efisien_ar_bd = \"Efisiensi Hari Rawat\"\n  )\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {#tbl-p-kombinasi .cell layout-align=\"center\" tbl-cap='Jumlah rumah sakit yang efisien menurut kombinasi Pabon-Lasso dan biaya satuan'}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nhospital |>\n  select(efisien_ar_op, efisien_ar_ip, efisien_ar_bd) |>\n  tbl_summary() |>\n  as_flex_table()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div cl